     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* CLAIMLF1 -- Logical file over CLAIMPF
     A* Library: ESH101
     A*
     A* Purpose:
     A*   Provides access to claims keyed by POLID + CLAIMNO.
     A*   Used in RPG to READE all claims for a given policy.
     A*   The RPG program CHAINs on POLID, then READEs while POLID matches.
     A*
     A* Compile after CLAIMPF exists:
     A*   CRTLF FILE(ESH101/CLAIMLF1) SRCFILE(ESH101/QDDSSRC) SRCMBR(CLAIMLF1)
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A          R CLAIMREC                  PFILE(ESH101/CLAIMPF)
     A          K POLID
     A          K CLAIMNO
